data: {"id": "57b24b0ded8f4504-thinking-parallel_evidence-1383", "run_id": "57b24b0ded8f4504", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 |\n|------|----------|\n| **Pod 状态** | `Running` 但 `ContainersNotReady`，`Ready=False`，等待原因 `CrashLoopBackOff` |\n| **重启次数** | 6 次（Metrics 确认 `restarts_total=6`） |\n| **Last State** | `Terminated`，Reason=`Error`，**Exit Code=1** |\n| **Previous Logs** | Python `Traceback` → `FileNotFoundError: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/input/app.conf'` |\n| **启动命令** | `python3 -u -c \"from pathlib import Path; print(Path('/input/app.conf').read_text())\"` |\n| **Volume** | `inpu", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789136596567, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

